1
00:00:10,360 --> 00:00:12,630
♪Wealth fades away, fame fades away♪

2
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:16,790
♪All worldly pursuits are fleeting
dreams♪

3
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:19,350
♪Sorrow fades away, resentment fades
away♪

4
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:22,870
♪Anger and grudges are but passing
clouds♪

5
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:26,640
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

6
00:00:26,730 --> 00:00:30,150
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

7
00:00:34,880 --> 00:00:37,230
♪This humble monk wanders freely across
the land♪

8
00:00:38,160 --> 00:00:40,430
♪Laughing and fooling around, yet bound
by karma's law♪

9
00:00:41,240 --> 00:00:43,950
♪People spend their lives chasing
fortune and fearing misfortune♪

10
00:00:44,640 --> 00:00:47,110
♪Yet in a blink, all return to dust♪

11
00:00:47,920 --> 00:00:50,230
♪They scheme endlessly in pursuit of
wealth and glory♪

12
00:00:51,200 --> 00:00:53,580
♪But in the end, all things simply pass
by♪

13
00:00:54,440 --> 00:00:57,350
♪Better to follow the heart and find
true joy♪

14
00:00:57,640 --> 00:01:00,550
♪Don't let worldly troubles bind your
soul♪

15
00:01:00,880 --> 00:01:02,190
♪Walk on, walk on♪

16
00:01:02,560 --> 00:01:03,870
♪Roam on, roam on♪

17
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:07,430
♪With my worn-out fan in hand, I care
not for worldly woes♪

18
00:01:07,440 --> 00:01:08,750
♪Drink some wine♪

19
00:01:09,120 --> 00:01:10,510
♪Sail the rivers wide♪

20
00:01:10,520 --> 00:01:13,910
♪Simple robes and straw sandals beat
fine silk and fur♪

21
00:01:13,920 --> 00:01:17,070
♪Laugh at my carefree ways, a simple fan
is all I need to chase worries away♪

22
00:01:17,080 --> 00:01:20,470
♪Laugh at my shabby look, a half pot of
wine carries me through the years♪

23
00:01:20,480 --> 00:01:23,750
♪Wine and meat may pass through me, but
kindness stays in my heart♪

24
00:01:23,760 --> 00:01:27,030
♪I cling not to appearances, finding
freedom through Zen's wisdom♪

25
00:01:27,040 --> 00:01:29,070
♪I travel north and south, witnessing
the world's endless tales♪

26
00:01:29,880 --> 00:01:32,540
♪I see life's joys and sorrows in a
single glance♪

27
00:01:33,080 --> 00:01:36,150
♪Those who harm the good and abuse their
power will face their reckoning♪

28
00:01:36,160 --> 00:01:39,630
♪Do good and cultivate virtue, and
worries will fade away♪

29
00:01:39,640 --> 00:01:41,990
♪Don't frown over gains and losses♪

30
00:01:42,240 --> 00:01:45,750
♪True cultivation lies in a joyful
heart♪

31
00:01:46,120 --> 00:01:48,870
♪Let right and wrong, love and hatred
drift away with the wind♪

32
00:01:48,880 --> 00:01:52,990
♪Live freely and wander this world
without restraint♪

33
00:01:53,780 --> 00:01:56,380
=The Mad Monk: Subdue Demons of Dragon's Fall=
=Episode 10=

34
00:01:58,100 --> 00:01:58,500
Oh.

35
00:01:59,300 --> 00:02:00,620
Well, well!

36
00:02:01,420 --> 00:02:03,340
Jade Empress!

37
00:02:03,740 --> 00:02:04,340
Wow!

38
00:02:04,340 --> 00:02:05,300
Long time no see.

39
00:02:05,300 --> 00:02:06,580
You haven't changed a bit.

40
00:02:06,580 --> 00:02:07,180
Impressive.

41
00:02:07,180 --> 00:02:07,460
Here.

42
00:02:08,620 --> 00:02:09,300
I have

43
00:02:09,380 --> 00:02:10,660
a gift for you.

44
00:02:10,660 --> 00:02:11,340
Here.

45
00:02:18,460 --> 00:02:19,220
Eat it.

46
00:02:19,940 --> 00:02:20,780
Old friend.

47
00:02:20,860 --> 00:02:21,420
How dare you!

48
00:02:21,420 --> 00:02:22,220
Oh!

49
00:02:22,420 --> 00:02:23,580
W-Wait...

50
00:02:23,580 --> 00:02:25,340
You dare make a fool of me?

51
00:02:25,540 --> 00:02:26,820
Oh, no!

52
00:02:26,820 --> 00:02:28,300
- Mercy, Your Majesty!
- Mercy, Your Majesty!

53
00:02:28,300 --> 00:02:29,180
Enough, enough.

54
00:02:29,740 --> 00:02:30,460
Thank you, Your Majesty.

55
00:02:31,940 --> 00:02:33,900
I came down here in secret.

56
00:02:34,500 --> 00:02:35,749
I don't want too many people

57
00:02:35,750 --> 00:02:36,820
to know who I am.

58
00:02:37,460 --> 00:02:37,900
Oh.

59
00:02:38,420 --> 00:02:39,980
What could be so important

60
00:02:39,980 --> 00:02:41,980
that brought you here yourself?

61
00:02:43,020 --> 00:02:44,260
It's because of you.

62
00:02:44,900 --> 00:02:45,660
Me?

63
00:02:47,060 --> 00:02:49,820
You talked the Jade Emperor
into partying with celestial maidens.

64
00:02:50,220 --> 00:02:51,460
I haven't settled that score yet.

65
00:02:51,820 --> 00:02:52,500
Me?

66
00:02:53,180 --> 00:02:54,980
I've been framed!

67
00:02:55,740 --> 00:02:56,860
I know you were.

68
00:02:57,180 --> 00:02:57,860
Ah.

69
00:02:58,620 --> 00:03:00,740
To save the Jade Emperor's face,

70
00:03:01,060 --> 00:03:02,260
I punished you in public

71
00:03:02,260 --> 00:03:03,620
and took your spiritual power.

72
00:03:03,980 --> 00:03:04,340
Mm.

73
00:03:04,740 --> 00:03:06,620
I wanted him to kneel

74
00:03:06,620 --> 00:03:07,460
and apologize.

75
00:03:07,980 --> 00:03:09,580
But he refused.

76
00:03:09,740 --> 00:03:10,620
Oh my.

77
00:03:10,620 --> 00:03:11,980
You wanted the Jade Emperor to kneel?

78
00:03:12,420 --> 00:03:14,242
Then everyone in the Three Realms

79
00:03:14,243 --> 00:03:15,660
would know he's afraid of his wife.

80
00:03:17,100 --> 00:03:18,980
Haven't you heard that mortal saying?

81
00:03:18,980 --> 00:03:19,980
It goes like this:

82
00:03:20,180 --> 00:03:21,200
In this world,

83
00:03:21,500 --> 00:03:22,980
no man is afraid of his wife.

84
00:03:23,220 --> 00:03:25,220
He just respects her.

85
00:03:25,540 --> 00:03:27,740
If he won't kneel, he disrespects me.

86
00:03:28,020 --> 00:03:29,100
If he disrespects me,

87
00:03:29,460 --> 00:03:31,140
I'll run away from home.

88
00:03:31,140 --> 00:03:31,460
No...

89
00:03:32,260 --> 00:03:32,700
Hey.

90
00:03:32,860 --> 00:03:33,620
He... he...

91
00:03:33,820 --> 00:03:34,980
Actually,

92
00:03:35,500 --> 00:03:37,860
couples fight and make up.

93
00:03:37,860 --> 00:03:40,180
It's really no big deal.

94
00:03:40,180 --> 00:03:42,060
You don't need to leave home over it.

95
00:03:42,060 --> 00:03:42,820
Ugh.

96
00:03:42,820 --> 00:03:44,540
All men are the same.

97
00:03:45,020 --> 00:03:47,420
He used to call me his sweetheart.

98
00:03:47,820 --> 00:03:49,047
Now we sleep in separate rooms.

99
00:03:49,048 --> 00:03:50,100
It's been thousands of years.

100
00:03:50,100 --> 00:03:50,980
What?

101
00:03:50,980 --> 00:03:51,740
Oh my.

102
00:03:51,740 --> 00:03:52,780
Scum!

103
00:03:52,780 --> 00:03:53,340
Hey.

104
00:03:53,580 --> 00:03:54,780
Shut up. Keep your voice down.

105
00:03:55,820 --> 00:03:57,180
Who are you?

106
00:03:57,340 --> 00:03:58,260
She... she...

107
00:03:58,380 --> 00:03:59,100
She's my...

108
00:03:59,100 --> 00:03:59,900
Did I ask you?

109
00:04:01,540 --> 00:04:01,900
Uh...

110
00:04:02,900 --> 00:04:04,060
He's my master.

111
00:04:04,060 --> 00:04:05,220
I'm his disciple.

112
00:04:05,700 --> 00:04:06,740
My name's Liu Piaopiao.

113
00:04:06,800 --> 00:04:07,100
Good.

114
00:04:08,300 --> 00:04:09,380
I like you.

115
00:04:09,380 --> 00:04:09,900
Mm.

116
00:04:10,420 --> 00:04:12,860
I'll make you a celestial maiden.

117
00:04:15,020 --> 00:04:16,220
Thank you, Your Majesty.

118
00:04:17,420 --> 00:04:17,820
Huh?

119
00:04:18,620 --> 00:04:19,020
I...

120
00:04:19,740 --> 00:04:20,780
Anyway,

121
00:04:20,780 --> 00:04:21,894
I've had enough

122
00:04:21,895 --> 00:04:23,380
of a world controlled by men.

123
00:04:24,260 --> 00:04:26,180
This time, I'll unite

124
00:04:26,460 --> 00:04:27,900
demons and immortals of the Three Realms

125
00:04:28,300 --> 00:04:29,580
and overthrow the Jade Emperor.

126
00:04:30,140 --> 00:04:32,500
Then I'll rule the Three Realms.

127
00:04:33,740 --> 00:04:34,980
O-Overthrow the Jade Emperor?

128
00:04:35,580 --> 00:04:36,820
That's rebellion!

129
00:04:36,820 --> 00:04:38,140
Please reconsider, Your Majesty.

130
00:04:38,780 --> 00:04:39,500
Dragon-Subduing Arhat,

131
00:04:39,740 --> 00:04:41,460
I know you're close to the Jade Emperor.

132
00:04:41,780 --> 00:04:42,740
We're not close!

133
00:04:43,660 --> 00:04:45,740
We're just coworkers.

134
00:04:46,820 --> 00:04:48,820
I came down here to ask you:

135
00:04:49,260 --> 00:04:51,060
are you siding with him

136
00:04:54,020 --> 00:04:55,900
or with me?

137
00:04:58,020 --> 00:04:58,700
Hmm?

138
00:05:01,100 --> 00:05:02,940
If you side with me,

139
00:05:02,940 --> 00:05:04,540
once I'm in charge,

140
00:05:04,540 --> 00:05:06,660
I'll have Buddha make you a Bodhisattva.

141
00:05:06,820 --> 00:05:07,700
Your Majesty,

142
00:05:07,700 --> 00:05:08,620
actually,

143
00:05:08,620 --> 00:05:10,660
- what you do is your business.
- Mm.

144
00:05:11,260 --> 00:05:14,020
We monks of Lingshan

145
00:05:14,340 --> 00:05:15,300
value peace above all.

146
00:05:15,540 --> 00:05:17,340
We don't take sides.

147
00:05:17,980 --> 00:05:18,900
I know.

148
00:05:19,380 --> 00:05:21,500
You're still upset with me

149
00:05:21,500 --> 00:05:23,140
about what happened in Heaven.

150
00:05:23,140 --> 00:05:23,740
No.

151
00:05:23,740 --> 00:05:24,380
I really am not.

152
00:05:24,380 --> 00:05:25,220
Let me finish.

153
00:05:27,300 --> 00:05:28,620
That's why this time

154
00:05:28,940 --> 00:05:30,260
I've come in good faith.

155
00:05:30,260 --> 00:05:31,020
Huh?

156
00:05:31,980 --> 00:05:33,380
Yanzhi.

157
00:05:52,140 --> 00:05:53,260
Greetings, Your Majesty.

158
00:05:58,620 --> 00:05:59,700
Dragon-Subduing Arhat.

159
00:05:59,980 --> 00:06:00,500
Oh.

160
00:06:03,300 --> 00:06:04,780
Yanzhi?

161
00:06:10,060 --> 00:06:10,900
Hey.

162
00:06:11,340 --> 00:06:13,380
She's the Yanzhi you told me about?

163
00:06:13,380 --> 00:06:14,020
Mm.

164
00:06:14,780 --> 00:06:16,180
What's your relationship with her?

165
00:06:17,020 --> 00:06:18,260
Oh, she

166
00:06:18,260 --> 00:06:19,660
was my wife before I became a monk.

167
00:06:19,660 --> 00:06:20,860
Now she's an immortal

168
00:06:21,100 --> 00:06:22,260
and remembers nothing.

169
00:06:23,220 --> 00:06:24,180
In your previous life?

170
00:06:24,180 --> 00:06:24,780
Mm.

171
00:06:25,140 --> 00:06:25,820
Dragon-Subduing Arhat.

172
00:06:25,820 --> 00:06:26,500
Yes?

173
00:06:26,780 --> 00:06:27,420
Ah.

174
00:06:28,460 --> 00:06:29,660
If you're willing to help me...

175
00:06:29,900 --> 00:06:30,180
Yes?

176
00:06:30,340 --> 00:06:32,500
I'll let Yanzhi stay in the mortal world

177
00:06:32,500 --> 00:06:34,020
and help you fight demons.

178
00:06:35,700 --> 00:06:36,900
If you refuse,

179
00:06:39,020 --> 00:06:39,997
I'll tell her about your wedding night,

180
00:06:39,998 --> 00:06:41,220
when you abandoned her.

181
00:06:41,220 --> 00:06:42,020
You...

182
00:06:46,100 --> 00:06:47,220
As you command.

183
00:06:49,340 --> 00:06:49,980
Deal.

184
00:06:50,380 --> 00:06:50,900
How dare you!

185
00:06:52,460 --> 00:06:52,860
Hey...

186
00:06:53,980 --> 00:06:57,300
I hear you just got rid of Mr. Huang

187
00:06:57,300 --> 00:06:58,580
(Huang Residence)
and took over his estate.

188
00:06:58,580 --> 00:07:01,100
I'll use it as my temporary palace.

189
00:07:01,220 --> 00:07:01,580
Huh?

190
00:07:01,580 --> 00:07:02,380
- Your Majesty!
- Huh?

191
00:07:02,380 --> 00:07:03,460
Actually, this house

192
00:07:03,460 --> 00:07:04,860
was already returned to Mr. Huang Jr.

193
00:07:04,860 --> 00:07:06,620
It's his new home with Die.

194
00:07:07,140 --> 00:07:08,980
I'm the Jade Empress. I decide.

195
00:07:09,340 --> 00:07:10,220
Tell them to move out.

196
00:07:10,460 --> 00:07:11,100
Uh...

197
00:07:11,100 --> 00:07:11,980
In that case,

198
00:07:11,980 --> 00:07:13,260
would Your Majesty mind

199
00:07:13,380 --> 00:07:15,220
returning my spiritual power first?

200
00:07:16,220 --> 00:07:17,540
About that...

201
00:07:17,820 --> 00:07:19,540
Since I'm in the mortal realm now,

202
00:07:19,540 --> 00:07:22,020
the Jade Emperor still handles that.

203
00:07:22,020 --> 00:07:22,380
Alas.

204
00:07:22,380 --> 00:07:23,500
- Don't worry.
- Huh?

205
00:07:23,500 --> 00:07:24,340
Once I take power,

206
00:07:24,340 --> 00:07:25,180
I'll return it right away.

207
00:07:27,340 --> 00:07:29,120
I'll make that rotten man

208
00:07:29,121 --> 00:07:30,900
beg me for affection every day.

209
00:07:34,420 --> 00:07:34,940
Your Majesty.

210
00:07:35,140 --> 00:07:35,620
Your Majesty.

211
00:07:36,820 --> 00:07:37,540
Careful.

212
00:07:37,900 --> 00:07:38,900
Let me help you inside.

213
00:08:00,980 --> 00:08:01,820
Oh...

214
00:08:03,380 --> 00:08:04,380
Dragon-Subduing Arhat,

215
00:08:05,420 --> 00:08:07,460
you two are ancient history.

216
00:08:07,820 --> 00:08:10,140
Don't fall for her all over again.

217
00:08:11,140 --> 00:08:12,420
What "Dragon-Subduing Arhat"?

218
00:08:13,220 --> 00:08:14,300
Show some respect.

219
00:08:14,300 --> 00:08:15,220
You should still call me Master.

220
00:08:15,220 --> 00:08:16,020
Hey.

221
00:08:16,860 --> 00:08:18,860
I'm a celestial maiden now.

222
00:08:18,860 --> 00:08:19,700
From now on,

223
00:08:19,940 --> 00:08:21,340
we're equals.

224
00:08:26,340 --> 00:08:27,380
Oh...

225
00:08:27,380 --> 00:08:29,020
(Mahavira Hall)

226
00:08:34,180 --> 00:08:35,500
Oh my.

227
00:08:38,020 --> 00:08:38,740
Oh my.

228
00:08:38,940 --> 00:08:39,460
What's wrong?

229
00:08:40,100 --> 00:08:41,100
Hey, hey!

230
00:08:41,250 --> 00:08:44,100
I hear you got all Mr. Huang's wealth.

231
00:08:44,540 --> 00:08:46,140
There should be 8,000 to 10,000 taels.

232
00:08:46,140 --> 00:08:47,100
We could expand this into

233
00:08:47,100 --> 00:08:49,140
the world's greatest temple!

234
00:08:49,780 --> 00:08:51,260
Exactly!

235
00:08:51,260 --> 00:08:52,500
I donated it all.

236
00:08:53,020 --> 00:08:53,460
What?

237
00:08:53,740 --> 00:08:55,620
You donated all that money?

238
00:08:55,620 --> 00:08:57,300
You're kidding!

239
00:08:57,300 --> 00:08:58,060
Not a cent left.

240
00:08:59,460 --> 00:08:59,860
Hey.

241
00:08:59,860 --> 00:09:00,460
Hey, hey!

242
00:09:01,380 --> 00:09:02,940
- What's wrong, Master?
- Congrats, Master!

243
00:09:03,220 --> 00:09:05,140
You've secured the overseer job now.

244
00:09:05,540 --> 00:09:06,780
When the time comes,

245
00:09:06,781 --> 00:09:08,020
don't forget to look after us.

246
00:09:08,020 --> 00:09:08,940
Come on. Say it.

247
00:09:09,420 --> 00:09:12,820
Greetings, Master Overseer!

248
00:09:12,820 --> 00:09:14,780
What overseer?

249
00:09:14,780 --> 00:09:16,060
This was all my fault.

250
00:09:16,060 --> 00:09:17,620
Greed blinded me.

251
00:09:17,940 --> 00:09:20,140
I insisted on fighting for the job

252
00:09:20,140 --> 00:09:22,260
and lost all my spiritual power.

253
00:09:22,260 --> 00:09:24,340
I even got caned by the authorities.

254
00:09:24,340 --> 00:09:25,180
- Alas.
- So,

255
00:09:25,180 --> 00:09:26,740
as for the overseer position,

256
00:09:26,740 --> 00:09:27,820
I don't want it anymore.

257
00:09:27,820 --> 00:09:28,300
Hey.

258
00:09:28,500 --> 00:09:29,500
You can have it back.

259
00:09:29,940 --> 00:09:30,660
Wow!

260
00:09:31,140 --> 00:09:31,820
Back to me?

261
00:09:31,820 --> 00:09:32,700
Great!

262
00:09:33,300 --> 00:09:34,380
I'm overseer again!

263
00:09:34,380 --> 00:09:37,180
Now Biqing can't say I have no status!

264
00:09:37,180 --> 00:09:39,260
- Happy now?
- You're in trouble.

265
00:09:39,260 --> 00:09:40,620
You betrayed Master.

266
00:09:40,940 --> 00:09:42,820
Master Overseer!

267
00:09:44,380 --> 00:09:45,020
Biqing!

268
00:09:45,020 --> 00:09:46,540
I'm back!

269
00:09:46,540 --> 00:09:47,340
Hey, hey!

270
00:09:47,860 --> 00:09:48,780
Why are you walking so fast?

271
00:09:48,780 --> 00:09:49,740
Oh...

272
00:09:51,700 --> 00:09:52,580
This is great!

273
00:10:08,260 --> 00:10:09,460
(Zen)
Abbot, please

274
00:10:09,660 --> 00:10:11,140
take good care of Master Guangliang.

275
00:10:11,380 --> 00:10:13,180
Though he's lazy and loves to eat,

276
00:10:13,500 --> 00:10:14,700
always has to come out on top,

277
00:10:15,100 --> 00:10:16,180
and lets lust cloud his judgment,

278
00:10:16,860 --> 00:10:18,220
he's completely devoted

279
00:10:18,340 --> 00:10:20,420
to Lingyin Temple.

280
00:10:20,940 --> 00:10:22,140
Lust clouds my judgment?

281
00:10:22,340 --> 00:10:24,700
I'm plenty smart, okay?

282
00:10:28,220 --> 00:10:28,580
Hey.

283
00:10:28,580 --> 00:10:29,940
Shh.

284
00:10:31,060 --> 00:10:31,820
Actually, I'm a

285
00:10:32,020 --> 00:10:34,420
(Zen)
Western Paradise attendant reborn.

286
00:10:34,420 --> 00:10:35,660
All these years,

287
00:10:35,660 --> 00:10:39,060
I've trained under Master Bala.

288
00:10:39,420 --> 00:10:42,460
Now the Three-Headed Jiao is sealed,

289
00:10:43,020 --> 00:10:44,580
my mission is complete.

290
00:10:45,220 --> 00:10:46,100
Tonight,

291
00:10:46,660 --> 00:10:48,260
I'll return to the Western Paradise.

292
00:10:50,260 --> 00:10:50,980
That's why

293
00:10:51,660 --> 00:10:54,380
I pushed him away and flattered you.

294
00:10:55,260 --> 00:10:56,740
I was afraid after I left,

295
00:10:57,020 --> 00:10:59,380
he'd be heartbroken.

296
00:11:00,900 --> 00:11:02,420
Amitabha Buddha.

297
00:11:02,580 --> 00:11:04,420
You've put a lot of thought into this.

298
00:11:04,420 --> 00:11:06,980
Guangliang will be blessed by you.

299
00:11:07,540 --> 00:11:08,020
Mm.

300
00:11:08,740 --> 00:11:09,380
What?

301
00:11:10,140 --> 00:11:11,780
Biqing is an immortal too?

302
00:11:12,100 --> 00:11:12,820
Master,

303
00:11:13,420 --> 00:11:14,620
he's leaving.

304
00:11:15,260 --> 00:11:16,060
Alas.

305
00:11:16,340 --> 00:11:18,860
No one's competing with me now.

306
00:11:18,860 --> 00:11:21,300
I'll still be your sidekick.

307
00:11:22,660 --> 00:11:23,460
Hey.

308
00:11:27,500 --> 00:11:29,700
I won't let Biqing leave like this.

309
00:11:31,820 --> 00:11:32,980
Ah.

310
00:11:32,980 --> 00:11:34,500
I've got it!

311
00:11:37,660 --> 00:11:38,220
Tsk.

312
00:11:38,500 --> 00:11:39,060
Hmph.

313
00:12:13,700 --> 00:12:14,980
To open this pagoda,

314
00:12:14,980 --> 00:12:16,580
please say the password.

315
00:12:17,860 --> 00:12:18,900
Password?

316
00:12:19,740 --> 00:12:20,300
Pass...

317
00:12:21,540 --> 00:12:22,580
(Li Jing Is the Most Handsome)

318
00:12:22,620 --> 00:12:24,460
Li Jing is the most handsome.

319
00:12:48,140 --> 00:12:51,190
♪My shoes are worn, my hat is torn♪

320
00:12:51,540 --> 00:12:54,390
♪Even my monk's robe is tattered♪

321
00:12:54,520 --> 00:12:58,190
♪Everything I own is worn and
weathered♪

322
00:12:58,200 --> 00:13:01,270
♪Yet I laugh and live free as can be♪

323
00:13:01,680 --> 00:13:08,430
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

324
00:13:08,440 --> 00:13:11,990
♪With Buddha dwelling in my heart♪

325
00:13:18,680 --> 00:13:21,910
♪Once, I was known as Li Xiuyuan♪

326
00:13:21,920 --> 00:13:25,150
♪Now I bear the name Ji Dian♪

327
00:13:25,440 --> 00:13:28,470
♪After the wedding, I became an
immortal♪

328
00:13:28,480 --> 00:13:30,150
♪I thought of the Arhat who subdued the
tiger♪

329
00:13:30,160 --> 00:13:32,070
♪And there he was, right by my side, oh
my♪

330
00:13:32,080 --> 00:13:33,630
♪I left my wife behind♪

331
00:13:33,800 --> 00:13:35,230
♪And headed straight to Lingyin Temple♪

332
00:13:35,240 --> 00:13:39,070
♪Living a life of hiding here and
running there♪

333
00:13:39,080 --> 00:13:40,190
♪As long as thunder doesn't strike♪

334
00:13:40,200 --> 00:13:42,310
♪I still dare to make a solemn vow♪

335
00:13:42,320 --> 00:13:43,990
♪With me around, nothing can go wrong♪

336
00:13:44,000 --> 00:13:45,870
♪Waiter, bring me a plate of chicken
wings♪

337
00:13:45,880 --> 00:13:49,230
♪People laugh and say I'm lost and
foolish♪

338
00:13:49,240 --> 00:13:52,510
♪Guangliang always nags and scolds me♪

339
00:13:52,720 --> 00:13:55,630
♪His endless lectures come from worry
I'll cause trouble♪

340
00:13:55,640 --> 00:13:58,990
♪I say Buddha lives within my heart♪

341
00:13:59,000 --> 00:14:02,670
♪Wine and meat may pass through my body♪

342
00:14:02,680 --> 00:14:06,030
♪I wander around, I stroll along♪

343
00:14:06,040 --> 00:14:09,110
♪Leaving all my worries behind♪

344
00:14:09,680 --> 00:14:12,750
♪Take a sip, take a bite♪

345
00:14:12,760 --> 00:14:16,190
♪I don't overthink this life of mine♪

346
00:14:16,200 --> 00:14:19,750
♪You chase fame and fight over fortune
and fate♪

347
00:14:19,760 --> 00:14:23,230
♪You're just wasting your time♪

348
00:14:23,240 --> 00:14:26,190
♪They all call me a Living Buddha♪

349
00:14:26,200 --> 00:14:27,870
♪And I just laugh happily♪

350
00:14:27,880 --> 00:14:31,270
♪Wishing joy and happiness for all in
this world♪

351
